WEBVTT

00:12:00.299 --> 00:12:05.554
People everywhere
are dying to be seen and heard,

00:12:05.596 --> 00:12:07.514
to know how they matter.

00:12:08.432 --> 00:12:10.559
They're dying to get your Gracenote.

00:12:11.769 --> 00:12:14.021
So that is my death wish.

00:12:15.022 --> 00:12:18.901
That you see how your note,
no matter what form it takes,

00:12:18.942 --> 00:12:23.113
is like an oasis in a desert of people

00:12:23.155 --> 00:12:26.825
who are thirsty to know
they're making a difference.

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:29.495
Like my dad said,

00:12:29.495 --> 00:12:32.623
it's better than having
a eulogy read over a casket.